      "batch": "part-06",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p002036",
      "observations": [
        "古来来奔、请封、后续册封各有阶段，卷324另记经过。具体来奔路径待考。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "batch": "part-06",
      "paragraph_id": "mingshi-2f603db3d81e-p002038",
      "observations": [
        "各次贡使到达日期待核。"
      ]
    },
